~ ryo_level_3_intro_first_boss
War Saucer: Human, earth's airspace now belongs to the Empire. Withdraw or be destroyed.
Ryo: It won't be for much longer.
Radio Control: Ryo, those twin war saucers are defensive units.
Ryo: Well, what else...
Radio Control: I was able to analyze them and conclude that their turrets are their weak points.
Ryo: Understood. I'll take those things down.
=> END

